{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the natural numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3545551b3d62c4e23d5df7352a55602d0aa9adcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&#39;$\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/58815ae11e96f425f64686a2371b7cdfe1431f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&gt;P&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />, are divided by the natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, the remainders are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e5279d3f896ef9c6f82885a1936100390b02c000.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R&#39;$\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/8258a920efc08be7999c5eb6e90a4c496b949eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PP&#39;$\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/7/c077caf1edeae5078f4966d66747364f531ece3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RR&#39;$\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> are divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, the remainders are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/b/8db99a3261aeba6b17548670b2445e79d4d0e4c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r&#39;$\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/e/b9ed9f8b110d163539fa391733a1261b4037558c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } r&gt;r&#39; \\text{  always}\\quad \\text{(B) } r&lt;r&#39; \\text{  always}\\quad\\\\ \\text{(C) } r&gt;r&#39; \\text{  sometimes and } r&lt;r&#39; \\text{  sometimes}\\quad\\\\ \\text{(D) } r&gt;r&#39; \\text{  sometimes and } r=r&#39; \\text{  sometimes}\\quad\\\\ \\text{(E) } r=r&#39; \\text{  always}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"78\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The divisors are the same, so take each variable <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modulo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modulo\">modulo</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/8/3b8cdaceed647dae9e4e606601fd999465140125.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P \\equiv R \\pmod{D}\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f087839bc20d70399cc8044b8aff9acdd324d47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P&#39; \\equiv R’ \\pmod{D}\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />\nThat means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b0af997819124e7d515103839f03ef5a612c3f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[PP’ \\equiv RR’ \\pmod{D}\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/777b4f6689845d18f9a396c1431076327fec0bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PP’$\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa5e6ad556795164bb119538db226b75587e74c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RR’$\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> have the same remainder when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</